# Migration assessment: `OVHcloud`, `Scaleway`, `UpCloud`

- Inventory file: `inventory.json`
- Source: `aws`
- Catalog: `OVHcloud` snapshot from `https://www.ovhcloud.com/en/public-cloud/prices/`, retrieved 2026-11-08
- Catalog: `Scaleway` snapshot from `https://www.scaleway.com/en/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-01
- Catalog: `UpCloud` snapshot from `https://upcloud.com/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-10-25

## Comparison

### Summary

| Fit | `OVHcloud` | `Scaleway` | `UpCloud` |
|---|---|---|---|
| direct | 2 | 2 | 0 |
| partial | 1 | 1 | 2 |
| none | 2 | 2 | 3 |
| total | 5 | 5 | 5 |

### Resources

| ID | Category | `OVHcloud` fit | `OVHcloud` best offering | `Scaleway` fit | `Scaleway` best offering | `UpCloud` fit | `UpCloud` best offering |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-example` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` | direct | `Object Storage` | partial | `Object Storage` |
| `db-example` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL` | direct | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL` | none |  |
| `fn-example` | `serverless.function` | none |  | none |  | none |  |
| `misc-example` | `unclassified` | none |  | none |  | none |  |
| `partial-example` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Public Cloud Instances` | partial | `Instances` | partial | `Cloud Server` |

### Blockers on every target

- `fn-example`
  - `OVHcloud`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
  - `Scaleway`: no offering in the `Scaleway` catalog for `serverless.function`
  - `UpCloud`: no offering in the `UpCloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `misc-example`
  - `OVHcloud`: not classified
  - `Scaleway`: not classified
  - `UpCloud`: not classified

## `OVHcloud`

### Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 2 |
| partial | 1 |
| none | 2 |
| total | 5 |

### Resources

| ID | Raw type | Category | Fit | Best offering | Reasons |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-example` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` | `Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL` | `Managed PostgreSQL` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `fn-example` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `misc-example` | `AWS::CloudFormation::CustomResource` | `unclassified` | none |  | not classified |
| `partial-example` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Public Cloud Instances` | `Public Cloud Instances` does not offer `node-high-availability` |

### Required changes

- `partial-example`: `node-high-availability` (not offered by `Public Cloud Instances`)

### Blockers

- `fn-example`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `misc-example`: not classified

## `Scaleway`

### Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 2 |
| partial | 1 |
| none | 2 |
| total | 5 |

### Resources

| ID | Raw type | Category | Fit | Best offering | Reasons |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-example` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` | `Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL` (tie: `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL`) | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `fn-example` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  | no offering in the `Scaleway` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `misc-example` | `AWS::CloudFormation::CustomResource` | `unclassified` | none |  | not classified |
| `partial-example` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` | `Instances` does not offer `node-high-availability`; `Instances` does not offer `snapshots` |

### Required changes

- `partial-example`: `node-high-availability`, `snapshots` (not offered by `Instances`)

### Blockers

- `fn-example`: no offering in the `Scaleway` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `misc-example`: not classified

## `UpCloud`

### Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 0 |
| partial | 2 |
| none | 3 |
| total | 5 |

### Resources

| ID | Raw type | Category | Fit | Best offering | Reasons |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-example` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | partial | `Object Storage` | `Object Storage` does not offer `object-versioning` |
| `db-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | none |  | no offering in the `UpCloud` catalog for `database.postgresql` |
| `fn-example` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  | no offering in the `UpCloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `misc-example` | `AWS::CloudFormation::CustomResource` | `unclassified` | none |  | not classified |
| `partial-example` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Cloud Server` | `Cloud Server` does not offer `node-high-availability` |

### Required changes

- `bucket-example`: `object-versioning` (not offered by `Object Storage`)
- `partial-example`: `node-high-availability` (not offered by `Cloud Server`)

### Blockers

- `db-example`: no offering in the `UpCloud` catalog for `database.postgresql`
- `fn-example`: no offering in the `UpCloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `misc-example`: not classified
